      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}\n\nThe difference between background and UI Themes is that UI themes are exclusively VRC+, however, backgrounds have non-VRC+ backgrounds. So it makes sense to have them in both of these places.\n\nThe UI is cluttered as is already, I don't think it's really necessary to clutter it even more.",
