      "value": "@{5eff476248ee5765bbf3f17a|full_name}: I take having something duplicate over having it not where it belongs to. UI Themes are a UI Setting which is why they should be in the User Interface Settings.\n\nImagine a friend tells you that you can change your UI color with VRChat+, where are they going to look for it first? UI Settings obviously.\n\nNot putting it there would be as if Discord would put Profile Banners in the Nitro Category of their Settings instead of in the Profile Settings.",
