  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now the UI Themes are only available through the VRChat+ Tab and not in the Settings Tab.\n\nThis is a bit weird to me as:\n\n1. It's also just a UI Setting  \n\n2. Other VRChat+ \"Features\" such as backgrounds are also in the UI Settings\n\n3. It makes it harder for users to find\n\n4. None VRC+ Users will probably not run into it\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAlso add the UI Themes to the User Interface Category of the Main Menu Settings Tab, just as VRChat+ backgrounds already are.",
